# Identity Server

- Issuer default: `https://localhost:7036`; metadata at `/.well-known/openid-configuration`.
- Application Registry is separate from OpenIddict client store; map permissions in Infrastructure.
- Dynamic CORS merges `Cors:AllowedOrigins` with active SPA registry origins.
- SQLite in Development via `appsettings.Development.json`; production-style uses SQL Server connection string shape.